 class=\"font-display font-bold text-lg shrink-0\" style=\"color: rgba(0,95,107,.25);\" data-kid=\"156\">02</span>\n              <div data-kid=\"157\">\n                <div class=\"trend-title font-display font-semibold text-sm leading-snug\" style=\"color: var(--ink);\" data-kid=\"158\">CRISPR Explained for High Schoolers</div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs mt-0.5\" style=\"color: rgba(20,35,38,.4);\" data-kid=\"159\">Biology · 5 min</div>\n              </div>\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"trend-item flex gap-3 group\" data-kid=\"160\">\n              <span class=\"font-display font-bold text-lg shrink-0\" style=\"color: rgba(0,95,107,.25);\" data-kid=\"161\">03</span>\n              <div data-kid=\"162\">\n                <div class=\"trend-title font-display font-semibold text-sm leading-snug\" style=\"color: var(--ink);\" data-kid=\"163\">Building a Line-Following Robot in a Weekend</div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs mt-0.5\" style=\"color: rgba(20,35,38,.4);\" data-kid=\"164\">Robotics · 7 min</div>\n              </div>\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"trend-item flex gap-3 group\" data-kid=\"165\">\n              <span class=\"font-display font-bold text-lg shrink-0\" style=\"color: rgba(0,95,107,.25);\" data-kid=\"166\">04</span>\n              <div data-kid=\"167\">\n                <div class=\"trend-title font-display font-semibold text-sm leading-snug\" style=\"color: var(--ink);\" data-kid=\"168\">The Chemistry of Color-Changing Reactions</div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs mt-0.5\" style=\"color: rgba(20,35,38,.4);\" data-kid=\"169\">Chemistry · 4 min</div>\n              </div>\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"trend-item flex gap-3 group\" data-kid=\"170\">\n              <span class=\"font-display font-bold text-lg shrink-0\" style=\"color: rgba(0,95,107,.25);\" data-kid=\"171\">05</span>\n              <div data-kid=\"172\">\n                <div class=\"trend